.el .ds Aq '
.TH geectl-branch-link-package 1  "geectl-branch-link-package 0.2.4" 
.SH NAME
geectl\-branch\-link\-package \- Link a package to another package. A mutation: dry\-run is the default
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgeectl branch link\-package\fR [\fB\-\-force\fR] [\fB\-\-revision\fR] [\fB\-\-vrev\fR] [\fB\-\-cicount\fR] [\fB\-\-missing\-target\fR] [\fB\-\-disable\-build\fR] [\fB\-\-disable\-publish\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fB\-\-source\-project\fR> <\fB\-\-source\-package\fR> <\fB\-\-target\-project\fR> <\fB\-\-target\-package\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Link a package to another package. A mutation: dry\-run is the default
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-source\-project\fR \fI<SOURCE_PROJECT>\fR
The project to link from
.TP
\fB\-\-source\-package\fR \fI<SOURCE_PACKAGE>\fR
The package to link
.TP
\fB\-\-target\-project\fR \fI<TARGET_PROJECT>\fR
The project to link in
.TP
\fB\-\-target\-package\fR \fI<TARGET_PACKAGE>\fR
The package to link as
.TP
\fB\-\-force\fR
Replace an existing link in the target package
.TP
\fB\-\-revision\fR \fI<REVISION>\fR
Pin the link at this source revision (a number or an md5)
.TP
\fB\-\-vrev\fR \fI<VREV>\fR
The link\*(Aqs vrev attribute
.TP
\fB\-\-cicount\fR \fI<CICOUNT>\fR
The link\*(Aqs cicount attribute: `add`, `copy`, or `local`
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
add
.IP \(bu 2
copy
.IP \(bu 2
local
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-missing\-target\fR
Allow the link to point at a package that does not exist yet
.TP
\fB\-\-disable\-build\fR
Disable building the target package
.TP
\fB\-\-disable\-publish\fR
Disable publishing the target package
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH VERSION
v0.2.4
